  "review": {
    "gallery": "Two October 2026 construction update photos and seven project brochure renders. The lead and listing show the building from Crescent Road. The brochure credits Ellington, Northacre and SOL Properties. No handover status is inferred from the façade photographs.",
    "location": "The developer brochure names Crescent Road and visually identifies the site on the northeastern crescent. The Mitchell’s and JRE points agree within about 12 metres. Fifteen of the original driving estimates are shown. The Pointe entry was excluded because current access was unconfirmed. Dubai Holding confirmed the Palm Jumeirah Mall name on 3 September 2025.",
    "floorPlans": "Twenty-five drawings: 18 home examples, five floor plates and two amenity sheets. Six two-layout spreads and the brochure penthouse spread were separated at the gutter, preserving headings, areas, drawings and keyed insets. The ninth-floor brochure layout differs from the four plan-book alternatives. The developer availability table has unit-specific variations from the plan examples. Minor component rounding differences are retained as printed."
  },
  "unavailable": [
    "Surveyed visitor entrance, current applicability of the brochure-only penthouse configuration, contracted drawings and verified finished interior photography."
  ]
